{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Tutorial5\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/NoteMapper.php:112 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Db/NoteMapper.php:140 new DateTime()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 2 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Db/NoteMapper.php:112 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Db/NoteMapper.php:140 new DateTime()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "openapi-missing",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app has 5 OCS routes and no openapi.json. Clients of OCS are generated from such a specification, and nothing else tells them what these routes take and return."
      ]
    }
  ],
